title: '`frame-metadata-hash-extension`: uncovered extension paths in tests'

doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      Adds unit tests for previously uncovered paths of `CheckMetadataHash`: a custom hash comes
      back in the implicit, mode 0 yields `None` and never errors with `RUNTIME_METADATA_HASH`
      unset, the encoding is exactly one mode byte, and `weight()` is zero. Also fixes rustdoc
      that overstated `RUNTIME_METADATA_HASH` as required.

crates:
  - name: frame-metadata-hash-extension
    bump: none
